          "pWrong": 0.56
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Aphelios:Jhin:1",
          "text": "Jhin's Deadly Flourish only roots you if he or an ally hit you in the last few seconds. Avoid trading basic attacks with him when he has it ready.",
          "refs": [
